	sh:targetClass tmodel:View .
tmodel:Vulnerability a sh:NodeShape ;
	rdfs:comment "A finding/vulnerability (CVE/NVD-shaped) that `affects` a Product (§2b). Propagation along uses_component/composed_of and the per-instance VEX override are Assertions plus Reviews (§5), not extra classes." ;
	sh:closed true ;
